description: Profile email policy for student/alumni create, import, and invite flows
---
# Profile Email Policy- Student profiles must have a required `schoolEmail`.
- Student `personalEmail` is optional.
- Alumni `schoolEmail` and `personalEmail` are both optional.
- Alumni profiles may exist as record-only entries without a linked `User`.
- Invite/claim flows require at least one valid email on the target profile.
- Admin/faculty can update email fields for unclaimed alumni profiles to enable later invites.